G6095.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at Ruth 4:19; 
son of: Hezron (H2696H); 
brother of: Jerahmeel (H3396), Caleb (H3612H), Segub (H7687H) and Ashhur (H0806); 
father of: Amminadab (H5992); also called Admin (KJV: Aram) at Luc 3:33; 
§ Arni (Proper name)
